  "title": "Tilapia with Tomatoes, Black Olives and Corn",
  "description": "Easy to make, and beautiful on the plate. This tilapia is cooked in the tomato sauce it is served with. The tomato sauce is made with diced tomatoes, garlic, corn, and black olives.",
  "authors": [
    "Marian Monroe"
